              <div>
        
  <section  class="paragraph paragraph--type--section paragraph--view-mode--default paragraph--type--section--white_bg" >
    <div class="container">
                        <h2  id="consulta-agenda-biblioteca" class="heading level-h2 bold-1">
  Consulta la agenda de la biblioteca  </h2>                  
      <div class="field field--name-subparagraphs field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden">
              




    

  
  
<div class="component-icon-box"><div  class="c-icon-boxes icon-boxes type-default col-1"><div
        class="field field--name-icon-box-items field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden"><div  class="c-icon-box-item icon-box-item"><div class="icon-content"><img src="/docs/assets/2018/04/11/agenda_rectangular_1_0.png" alt="Agenda"/></div><div class="info-content"><div class="content-element"><h3  id="icon-box-heading-29991" class="heading level-h4 bold-1">
  _  </h3><div class="field--name-description"><p>Entra en la agenda de actividades y conoce la programación para todas las edades: talleres de escritura, clubes de lectura, cuentacuentos, encuentros con autores, exposiciones, presentaciones de libros, itinerarios culturales, proyecciones..</p></div></div><div class="content-links"><a aria-label="Accede a la agenda" class="c-link link link-inline" href="/portal-lector/comunicacion/actividades?f%5B0%5D=biblioteca%3ABiblioteca%20P%C3%BAblica%20Miguel%20Hern%C3%A1ndez%20%28Puente%20de%20Vallecas%29" target="_self"><span>Accede a la agenda</span><svg class="iconMd micon material-symbols-keyboard_arrow_right" aria-hidden="true"><use xlink:href="/themes/custom/cm_pcen/assets/micon/material-symbols/symbol-defs.svg#material-symbols-keyboard_arrow_right"></use></svg></a></div></div></div></div></div></div>

              

